OL,3,GNEWSAChurch lit with 1,800 steel
OL,4,Aflowers for cancer charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city's historic church is being
OL,7,Filluminated with 1,800 specially
OL,8,Fdesigned steel flowers in honour of
OL,9,Fpeople affected by cancer.
OL,11,FThousands of people are expected at the
OL,12,FGarden of Light event at Liverpool's St
OL,13,FLuke's Bombed Out Church organised by
OL,14,Fthe Clatterbridge Cancer Charity.
OL,16,FThe flowers have poignant messages
OL,17,Fhanging from the petals dedicated to
OL,18,Fcancer patients or those who care for
OL,19,Fpeople with cancer at the Clatterbridge
OL,20,FCancer Centres in Liverpool, Wirral and
OL,21,FAintree as well tributes to those who
OL,22,Fhave died.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
